# Project Overview

This repository contains EntrepreneurOS.

EntrepreneurOS is a SaaS platform for founders to manage companies using AI agents.

Core architecture:

Frontend
- React
- Typescript
- React Query
- Tailwind
- ShadCN UI

Backend
- Node.js
- Express
- Drizzle ORM
- Postgres (Neon)

Auth
- Session auth
- Users table
- Companies table

Database structure
users
companies
agents
tasks
messages
notifications

Routing rules

Users must complete onboarding before accessing dashboard.

Flow:

register
login
check company
if company exists → dashboard
if no company → company setup

Coding standards

Frontend
- Use React Query for API calls
- Avoid raw fetch when possible
- Use functional components
- Use hooks

Backend
- API routes in server folder
- Database access through drizzle
- Return JSON responses

Architecture rules

Do not create duplicate API endpoints.

Do not modify database schema without updating shared/schema.ts.

Always maintain the onboarding flow:

Auth → Company → Dashboard.

When generating features prefer:

agents
tasks
company operations
AI workflow systems